## 5. Drug Safety Associate Summary & Action Plan

1. **ICSR Processing:** Case validated and processed as a Serious Expected ADR (ATT-Induced Hepatotoxicity) originating in India.
2. **Regulatory Reporting:** Expedited report submitted to the Pharmacovigilance Programme of India (PvPI) / Central Drugs Standard Control Organization (CDSCO) via the ADR Monitoring Centre (AMC) Vigiflow portal within the mandatory 15-calendar-day timeline.
3. **Risk Management Recommendation:** Reinforce routine liver function testing (LFT) at baseline, 2 weeks, 4 weeks, and monthly thereafter for all patients undergoing intensive Anti-Tubercular Therapy under national tuberculosis elimination programs.
